     "value": "Participants were cued to suppress, reappraise and appraise a series of 63 randomly intermixed trials in three blocks. Each trial began with a fixation cross, followed by a cue word, a blank preparation period, a negative high-arousing image presented for 10 s, a rating screen, and an 8-s RELAX period.",
